<title>UK: Smith &amp; Nephew up on renewed bid talk.</title>
<headline>Smith &amp; Nephew up on renewed bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Smith &amp; Nephew rose on Monday after a report in the Sunday Business newspaper revived talk of a takeover bid, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0926 GMT, the shares were up 5p to 195-3/4.</p>
<p>The healthcare products company has been the subject of bid talk for some time. --London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
